+/// The pinned line format (gh-1198 AC4): `… reasoning Ns` — single line,
+/// elapsed seconds, grep anchor `… reasoning`.
+String reasoningLivenessLine(int elapsedSeconds) =>
+    '… reasoning ${elapsedSeconds}s';
+
